        "settingsUdi": null
      }
    ]
  }
}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[We can work out your league or results table for you automatically. It'll save time for your results officer, and encourage more interest in your league as players watch the season develop.]]></Value>
